## Model card

- **Name:** Codestral
- **Short description:** Mistral AI’s Codestral is an open-weight 22B code model for low-latency code completion, fill-in-the-middle (FIM), and developer tool assistance (32K native context, extended on later checkpoints per metadata).
- **Provider / access:** Mistral AI and open-weight distribution (per announcement/metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/codestral`, pricing $0.30/$0.90 per 1M ($0.03 cached input), and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Mistral announcement reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `codestral`, `Codestral`.
- **Context window:** 32,768 tokens total (extended to 128K on later checkpoints per local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text and code input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.30/$0.90 per 1M input/output tokens ($0.03 cached input) per metadata.
- **Architecture:** 22B dense code model (open-weight as announced; licensing/variants may differ). Detailed architecture specifics beyond size not fully disclosed in reviewed content.

### Raw benchmarks found

> SELF-EXCLUSION: I reviewed Mistral’s original Codestral announcement, which reports performance on code-oriented evaluations (e.g. HumanEval pass@1, MBPP, Spider, RepoBench, CruxEval, multi-language HumanEval, FIM) in comparative charts/tables not fully extractable as clearly verifiable standardized numerics for this exact model/version in accessible text form during this pass. The announcement also mixes comparisons across tasks/versions and does not map cleanly to this repository’s required standardized benchmark categories (SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, GPQA, AIME, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact identity. To avoid unverifiable or misattributed scoring, this file is saved as `.md.excluded` (notes only; scores ignored).

Agent / tool use:

- Tuned for completion/FIM and developer assistance rather than autonomous multi-turn tool loops. Terminal-Bench 2.1 / Tau2 / Tau3 / GDPval-AA / Toolathon / MCP-Atlas: **no verified public score found**

Reasoning / knowledge:

- GPQA Diamond / HLE / AIME / AA Intelligence Index: **no verified public score found**

Coding:

- HumanEval/MBPP/Spider/RepoBench/FIM results reported in announcement context but not clearly extractable/verifiable as standardized numerics here; SWE-bench Verified / SWE-Pro / LiveCodeBench / SciCode: **no verified public score found**

Long context:

- 32K native context (extended on later checkpoints per metadata); RepoBench discussed but not clearly extractable as a verified numeric score in this pass.

Multimodal:

- Text/code only.

